        "original_id": "7f4f6c1a-2f7b-5f96-84da-d1aade7d0e5e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Seth Rollins, Colby Daniel Lopez, Dean Ambrose, Jirair S. Hovnanian, Curtis Axel, Joe Hennig, David Otunga\n- Organizations: WWE, The New Nexus\n- Products: WWE Raw Tag Team Championship, WWE Tag Team Championship\n- Roles: professional wrestler, actor, home builder\n- Places: New Jersey\n\nFacts:\n- Jirair S. Hovnanian was born on June 9, 1927, and he was an Armenian Iraqi-American home builder based in New Jersey.\n- Colby Daniel Lopez was born on May 28, 1986, and he is an American professional wrestler and actor.\n- In 2011, Joe Hennig won the WWE Tag Team Championship with David Otunga as a member of The New Nexus.\n- Colby Daniel Lopez is signed to WWE under the ring name Seth Rollins, where he performs on the Raw brand.\n- Dean Ambrose and Seth Rollins are the current WWE Raw Tag Team Champions, and they are in their first reign as a team.\n- Seth Rollins is currently one-half of Raw's Tag Team Champions with Dean Ambrose in his second reign as an individual and his first reign with Ambrose.\n- Jirair S. Hovnanian died on August 14, 2007.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
